  "forgot space fetches EMAIL_HOST_USER/PASSWORD but gates on EMAIL_HOST only.",
  "reset app success target 'sign-in?success=True'; reset app failure targets 'accounts/reset-password?<params>' (no trailing slash); space uses '<base>/accounts/reset-password/?<params>' (double slash)."
